{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "VodSync 影视数据同步服务",
    "description": "遍历 ziyuanzhan latest.json 源站列表，定时增量同步苹果 CMS(MacCMS) 影视数据到本地数据库，并对外提供统一的视频列表/详情 API（source 参数区分源站）。",
    "version": "1.4.1"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/categories": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Categories",
        "description": "分类清单（type_id / type_name 去重 + 各分类条数）。\n\n用法：\n  /api/v1/categories?source=jkun          单源站分类\n  /api/v1/categories?source=jkun,t1       多源合并（同名分类会合并计数）\n  /api/v1/categories                      全部源站合并\n拿到 type_id 后即可用 GET /api/v1/videos?source=..&type_id=.. 按分类翻页。",
        "operationId": "categories_api_v1_categories_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "source",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "源站 slug，逗号分隔多源；留空=全部源站合并",
              "default": "",
              "title": "Source"
            },
            "description": "源站 slug，逗号分隔多源；留空=全部源站合并"
          },
          {
            "name": "apikey",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "Apikey"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/healthz": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Healthz",
        "description": "健康检查 / 存活探针。\n\n关键点：数据库繁忙时**不返回 5xx**。容器健康检查只看 HTTP 状态码，\n若这里因为连接池排队而报 500/超时，Docker 会把一个其实还在正常干活的容器判定为不健康\n并反复重启（v1.4.0 在 NAS 上就表现为\"容器崩溃\"）。因此这里始终 200，\n用 db 字段表达数据库是否可用。",
        "operationId": "healthz_healthz_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "apikey",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "Apikey"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/sources": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "List Sources",
        "description": "所有源站及本地同步状态。\n\n字段口径（易混淆，特意分开）：\n  running       此刻是否有同步任务在跑（只有 true 才应该提供「暂停」操作）\n  running_mode  正在跑的类型：full / incremental\n  running_seconds 本次已运行秒数\n  syncing       全量同步是否「未跑完」（有断点），不代表正在跑，仅用于展示进度条\n  synced        是否同步过（无水位线、无数据、无断点 = false，进度恒为 0）\n  paused        该源站是否被单独暂停（持久化）",
        "operationId": "list_sources_api_v1_sources_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "apikey",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "Apikey"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/source": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Source Catalog",
        "description": "资源站 API 清单。\n\n对外提供「当前服务掌握的所有上游资源站」及其采集接口地址，方便下游客户端\n自行直连上游，或改用本服务的统一接口（local_api / local_list_api）。\n\n返回字段说明：\n  api             上游苹果 CMS 采集接口地址（可直接 ?ac=list / ?ac=detail 调用）\n  local_api       本服务的 MacCMS 兼容接口（同样支持 ?ac=list|detail）\n  local_list_api  本服务的 REST 列表接口\n  video_count     本服务已同步入库的条数（未同步为 0）\n  synced          是否已同步过（有水位线或已入库）",
        "operationId": "source_catalog_source_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "status",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "按状态过滤：ok / down，留空=全部",
              "default": "",
              "title": "Status"
            },
            "description": "按状态过滤：ok / down，留空=全部"
          },
          {
            "name": "only_ready",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "仅返回本地已有数据的源站",
              "default": false,
              "title": "Only Ready"
            },
            "description": "仅返回本地已有数据的源站"
          },
          {
            "name": "apikey",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "Apikey"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
